{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "Suno 逐词歌词时间戳（Beta 草稿）",
        "description": "未发布草稿。此接口正在开发与验收，示例不可视为线上可用性承诺。正式价格、开放范围和发布日期将在确认后公布。\n\n为已完成且属于当前账户的 Suno 歌曲获取逐词起止时间，适用于播放器高亮和歌词视频。本接口返回逐词数据，不提供独立的逐行时间戳。",
        "version": "0.1.0-draft"
    },
    "x-draft": true,
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
            "description": "未发布草稿。此接口正在开发与验收，示例不可视为线上可用性承诺。正式价格、开放范围和发布日期将在确认后公布。"
        }
    ],
    "security": [
        {
            "bearerAuth": []
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/v1/audios/lyrics/timestamps": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "获取或读取一首歌曲的逐词歌词时间戳",
                "operationId": "getSunoLyricsTimestamps",
                "description": "未发布草稿。此接口正在开发与验收，示例不可视为线上可用性承诺。正式价格、开放范围和发布日期将在确认后公布。\n\n同一账户对同一 source_task_id + result_id 重复提交，读取已有操作的最新状态或已保存结果，不会因为更换 API Key 或 Idempotency-Key 再次购买。API Key 必须仍有效且有权限。完成结果可在支持的保留期限内免费复读，余额为零也可读取已购结果。首次成功取得并保存符合交付标准的对齐数据后按单首歌曲收费；明确失败、纯音乐或无可用对齐数据不收费，已冻结费用退还。首版不交付部分或无效的歌词对齐，返回alignment_unavailable且不收费。\n\n由 [任务详情](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail) 获取：source_task_id 使用 EvoLink 音乐生成任务的 id；result_id 使用该任务 result_data 中所选歌曲的 result_id。同一次生成返回的不同歌曲分别处理，不需要重新生成歌曲。\n\n首次获取要求源歌曲仍可由原生成账号查询。已生成歌曲可以尝试，但不保证所有历史歌曲或超过14天的歌曲可取回；生成文件的保留期不等于时间戳可查询期限。纯音乐没有可对齐歌词。时间戳可能受漏词、重复副歌和演唱变化影响，制作成片前应核对音频。\n\n收到202后，按Retry-After等待，再使用相同source_task_id和result_id提交到本接口。处理中或结果核对中不会自动重新发起上游请求。即使首次HTTP响应丢失，也可以用相同两个ID找回操作。普通GET /v1/tasks/{id}查询的是音乐生成任务，不查询这个时间戳操作。\n\nupstream_unknown表示首次请求的结果仍在核对，不代表已经明确失败。服务会在有限核对窗口内收口；无法确认结果时退还冻结费用，并保留终态。普通重复提交不会重新购买；不要通过更换Idempotency-Key尝试再次收费。\n\n请求体必须是只包含source_task_id和result_id的单个JSON对象，不接受额外字段或尾随JSON；总大小最多4096字节。两个ID均不能为空或带前后空白；source_task_id最多50个UTF-8字节，result_id最多128个UTF-8字节。\n\n202响应的status为preparing、calling、upstream_unknown、awaiting_settlement或refund_pending，并返回Retry-After: 2；使用相同两个ID复查最新状态。completed返回200和words；failed、unknown_refunded返回422和error。每个操作响应均包含operation_id、source_task_id、result_id、cached、billing_status。资金状态为not_charged、reserved、refunded或paid，应以billing_status判断是否已冻结、扣费或退还。操作尚未建立时的错误响应只包含error。\n\n此Beta仅支持创建时使用custom_mode=true、且提供并保留了自定义歌词的已完成歌曲。自动生成歌词的模式，以及没有保留原自定义歌词的歌曲暂不支持。首次获取须先核实原生成账号、所选歌曲及有效音频时长，再开始付费对齐请求。缺少原歌词参考时返回422/source_lyrics_unavailable；无法核实音频时长时返回503/source_metadata_unavailable。这两种情况均在付费对齐请求前拒绝，不收费。\n\n收费并交付前，所有歌词片段都须有位于已核实时长内的有效时间，返回歌词还须按顺序完整覆盖创建时保留的自定义歌词；忽略分词、空白和标点差异。章节标签可保留在words中，不作为缺失的实唱歌词。缺词、额外词、覆盖不全或时间畸形均返回alignment_unavailable并退还冻结费用。此检查比对的是返回文本与保留歌词，不证明每个时间戳都与实唱吻合；真实V6对齐质量仍需试听实测。",
                "tags": [
                    "Suno"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimestampRequest"
                            },
                            "example": {
                                "source_task_id": "task-unified-example",
                                "result_id": "song-example"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "对齐已完成并保存；cached=true表示读取已有结果，本次不收费。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CompletedResponse"
                                },
                                "example": {
                                    "operation_id": "lyrics-operation-example",
                                    "status": "completed",
                                    "source_task_id": "task-unified-example",
                                    "result_id": "song-example",
                                    "cached": false,
                                    "words": [
                                        {
                                            "text": "Hello ",
                                            "start": 1.2,
                                            "end": 1.6,
                                            "aligned": true
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "again",
                                            "start": 1.7,
                                            "end": 2.1,
                                            "aligned": true
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "billing_status": "paid"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "202": {
                        "description": "操作尚未完成或结果正在核对。等待Retry-After后以相同两个ID复查。",
                        "headers": {
                            "Retry-After": {
                                "description": "再次查询同一操作前需等待的秒数。",
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "integer",
                                    "minimum": 1
                                },
                                "example": 2
                            }
                        },
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingResponse"
                                },
                                "example": {
                                    "operation_id": "lyrics-operation-example",
                                    "status": "upstream_unknown",
                                    "source_task_id": "task-unified-example",
                                    "result_id": "song-example",
                                    "cached": true,
                                    "billing_status": "reserved"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "参数、权限、源歌曲状态、支持范围、额度、对齐可用性或服务错误。返回稳定error.code；如有未完成的操作，继续用相同两个ID复查，不创建新的购买。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "源歌曲没有可用的原自定义歌词、为纯音乐，或操作已终止且未交付时间戳（failed或unknown_refunded）。操作终态响应包含billing_status，可能为not_charged或refunded。重复相同请求只读取终态，不会再次购买。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "anyOf": [
                                        {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FailedOperationResponse"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "examples": {
                                    "unknown_refunded": {
                                        "value": {
                                            "operation_id": "lyrics-operation-example",
                                            "status": "unknown_refunded",
                                            "source_task_id": "task-unified-example",
                                            "result_id": "song-example",
                                            "cached": true,
                                            "billing_status": "refunded",
                                            "error": {
                                                "code": "upstream_outcome_unknown",
                                                "message": "Upstream outcome could not be confirmed; reservation refunded; no automatic retry",
                                                "type": "api_error"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "no_lyrics": {
                                        "value": {
                                            "error": {
                                                "code": "no_lyrics",
                                                "message": "Instrumental songs have no lyric timestamps.",
                                                "type": "invalid_request_error"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "source_lyrics_unavailable": {
                                        "value": {
                                            "error": {
                                                "code": "source_lyrics_unavailable",
                                                "message": "This beta requires the original saved lyrics to verify alignment coverage.",
                                                "type": "invalid_request_error"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "请求体、ID、支持的源歌曲或端点不合法。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "API Key缺失、无效或已过期。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "API Key无访问权限或不能开始新的付费请求。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "未找到属于当前账户的源任务或所选歌曲。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "409": {
                        "description": "源音乐生成任务尚未完成。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "description": "请求频率超限。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "暂不支持新的获取请求、无法核实原生成账号或有效源音频时长、价格不可用，或服务暂时异常。",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                },
                                "example": {
                                    "error": {
                                        "code": "source_metadata_unavailable",
                                        "message": "The source audio duration could not be verified.",
                                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "bearerAuth": {
                "type": "http",
                "scheme": "bearer",
                "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key ：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
            }
        },
        "schemas": {
            "TimestampRequest": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "source_task_id",
                    "result_id"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                    "source_task_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1,
                        "description": "已完成且属于当前账户的 EvoLink Suno 音乐生成任务ID。不能为空、不能有前后空白，最多50个UTF-8字节。",
                        "maxLength": 50
                    },
                    "result_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1,
                        "description": "所选歌曲的result_id，必须属于source_task_id；不要填整首任务ID或音频URL。不能为空、不能有前后空白，最多128个UTF-8字节。",
                        "maxLength": 128
                    }
                }
            },
            "CompletedResponse": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "operation_id",
                    "status",
                    "source_task_id",
                    "result_id",
                    "cached",
                    "words",
                    "billing_status"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "operation_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "本次时间戳操作的稳定ID，与音乐生成任务ID不同。",
                        "example": "lyrics-operation-example"
                    },
                    "source_task_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "task-unified-example"
                    },
                    "result_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "song-example"
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "completed"
                    },
                    "cached": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否复用已有操作。复查已有操作不会开始新的购买；完成结果cached=true表示本次读取免费，不代表首次对齐免费。"
                    },
                    "words": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "minItems": 1,
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlignedWord"
                        },
                        "description": "收费并交付前，所有歌词片段都须有位于已核实时长内的有效时间，返回歌词还须按顺序完整覆盖创建时保留的自定义歌词；忽略分词、空白和标点差异。章节标签可保留在words中，不作为缺失的实唱歌词。缺词、额外词、覆盖不全或时间畸形均返回alignment_unavailable并退还冻结费用。此检查比对的是返回文本与保留歌词，不证明每个时间戳都与实唱吻合；真实V6对齐质量仍需试听实测。"
                    },
                    "billing_status": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BillingStatus"
                    }
                }
            },
            "PendingResponse": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "operation_id",
                    "status",
                    "source_task_id",
                    "result_id",
                    "billing_status",
                    "cached"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "operation_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "本次时间戳操作的稳定ID，与音乐生成任务ID不同。",
                        "example": "lyrics-operation-example"
                    },
                    "source_task_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "task-unified-example"
                    },
                    "result_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "song-example"
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "preparing",
                            "calling",
                            "upstream_unknown",
                            "awaiting_settlement",
                            "refund_pending"
                        ]
                    },
                    "billing_status": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BillingStatus"
                    },
                    "cached": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    }
                }
            },
            "AlignedWord": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "text",
                    "start",
                    "end",
                    "aligned"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "text": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "按演唱顺序返回的歌词片段；空白、换行或章节标签可能保留，不要假设每项都是一个可高亮单词。"
                    },
                    "start": {
                        "type": [
                            "number",
                            "null"
                        ],
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "description": "相对歌曲开头的秒数，保留小数；未有效对齐时为null。"
                    },
                    "end": {
                        "type": [
                            "number",
                            "null"
                        ],
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "description": "相对歌曲开头的秒数，保留小数；未有效对齐时为null。"
                    },
                    "aligned": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "该片段是否具有有效对齐；false时不能将start/end当作准确时间。"
                    }
                }
            },
            "ErrorResponse": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "error"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "error": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorDetail"
                    }
                }
            },
            "BillingStatus": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                    "not_charged",
                    "reserved",
                    "refunded",
                    "paid"
                ],
                "description": "实际资金状态：not_charged表示本操作未成功冻结费用；reserved表示费用已冻结、尚待处理结果；paid表示已确认扣费；refunded表示冻结费用已退还。应独立于status检查此字段。"
            },
            "FailedOperationResponse": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "operation_id",
                    "status",
                    "source_task_id",
                    "result_id",
                    "cached",
                    "billing_status",
                    "error"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "operation_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "本次时间戳操作的稳定ID，与音乐生成任务ID不同。",
                        "example": "lyrics-operation-example"
                    },
                    "source_task_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "task-unified-example"
                    },
                    "result_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "song-example"
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "failed",
                            "unknown_refunded"
                        ]
                    },
                    "cached": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "billing_status": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BillingStatus"
                    },
                    "error": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorDetail"
                    }
                }
            },
            "ErrorDetail": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "code",
                    "message"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "code": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "稳定错误码。常见值包括invalid_request、model_not_allowed、model_endpoint_mismatch、source_not_found、unsupported_source、source_not_completed、no_lyrics、source_account_unavailable、pricing_unavailable、timestamps_unavailable、insufficient_quota、upstream_failed、alignment_unavailable、upstream_outcome_unknown、source_lyrics_unavailable、source_metadata_unavailable、permission_denied。"
                    },
                    "message": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "type": {
                        "type": "string"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
